{"aliases": ["shallow dof", "浅景深效果"], "applicable_path": "camera.depth_of_field", "candidate_value": "shallow", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "composition.framing", "values": ["close_up"]}, {"operator": "in", "path": "style.primary", "values": ["cinematic", "photorealistic"]}], "content": "当构图被确认为 close_up，且风格为 cinematic 或 photorealistic 时，景深优先选择 shallow：浅景深可压缩背景、隔离杂讯，让近景主体的视觉权重更集中。建议仅在 camera.depth_of_field 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提出；用户明确景深或需要环境可读时以用户值为准。shallow 是候选值层面的启发式，不描述具体光圈或虚化程度。", "content_hash": "0a38b7757b64fd0e7517fcb18f3520c13ac6bf41dcbc797b688cb5ac8139cc5b", "keywords": ["浅景深", "背景虚化", "特写", "主体隔离", "shallow depth of field", "bokeh", "close-up"], "knowledge_id": "camera.depth_of_field.shallow_for_close_up", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "camera.depth_of_field.shallow_for_close_up", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/camera.depth_of_field.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：近景特写的浅景深优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
{"aliases": ["deep dof", "深景深效果"], "applicable_path": "camera.depth_of_field", "candidate_value": "deep", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "composition.framing", "values": ["wide_shot"]}], "content": "当构图被确认为 wide_shot 时，景深优先选择 deep：大范围场景需要前景、主体与背景同时可辨，深景深能保留地点信息与空间层次，避免环境线索被虚化吞掉。建议仅在 camera.depth_of_field 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提出；用户明确的景深或浅景深需求优先。deep 不代表无限景深，也不承诺空间透视的准确性。", "content_hash": "e2c6c5ab559684c7845c26bd42499cbe13525751c23353cfa9b9110ef9606048", "keywords": ["深景深", "环境可读", "空间层次", "全景", "deep depth of field", "environment", "wide shot"], "knowledge_id": "camera.depth_of_field.deep_for_wide_shot", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "camera.depth_of_field.deep_for_wide_shot", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/camera.depth_of_field.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：广角场景的深景深优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
{"aliases": ["shallow dof seated", "坐姿浅景深"], "applicable_path": "camera.depth_of_field", "candidate_value": "shallow", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "subject.pose_action", "values": ["sitting"]}, {"operator": "in", "path": "lighting.character", "values": ["soft", "natural"]}], "content": "当姿态被确认为 sitting，且照明质感为 soft 或 natural 时，景深优先选择 shallow：坐姿常伴随更安静的情绪与更近的观看距离，浅景深能弱化背景陈设干扰，使主体成为唯一焦点。建议仅在 camera.depth_of_field 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提出；用户明确景深需求优先。该规则不使用主体身份、服装或语义级冲突判断，只依据已确认字段的精确值组合。", "content_hash": "92dafc890f531d6e0efaed541be6c463349d00cc05b56b2e83b75a9af0c8384e", "keywords": ["坐姿", "浅景深", "背景弱化", "焦点", "seated", "shallow depth of field", "soft light"], "knowledge_id": "camera.depth_of_field.shallow_for_seated_subject", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "camera.depth_of_field.shallow_for_seated_subject", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/camera.depth_of_field.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：坐姿柔光的浅景深优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
